# Token-efficient session start

Before exploring this repo:

1. Read **`docs/AGENT-MEMORY.md`** first (short handoff).
2. Do **not** auto-load `docs/SESSION-STATE.md`, `TODO.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, or `docs/sponsorship-crm-build-prompt.md` unless AGENT-MEMORY lacks the fact you need.
3. Prefer Grep/Glob with tight paths over reading large files.
4. After meaningful work, update the “Last updated / Shipped / Deferred” sections of `docs/AGENT-MEMORY.md` — keep it under ~120 lines.
5. One focused chunk per session; avoid re-analyzing the whole product.
